Only after success, print the actual wave-numbered integration observation. If this initial patch fails, stop immediately; retain any already-integrated work and do not rebuild automatically.

Then create the prescribed repair-base snapshot of the current integrated tree using the **recorded wave base**. Dispatch only task 5 from that snapshot. For an **in-place** wave, apply no patch and create no snapshot.

